- P1-05c evidence still found real vault-admission and LanceDB/orchestrator bypasses; a Graphiti exact-reader helper fix does not prove callers pass the correct group. SnapshotV3 still needs strict schema, bad-cache self-healing, and no ID truncation. [Task 1]
- Use official Codex app-server/subagents, Claude Goals/Agent SDK only in permitted phases, and a non-LLM supervisor. Third-party orchestration plugins may notify or show a read-only dashboard but must not control authorization, evidence, or merging. [Task 2]
- Permission stages are `ORCH-BOOTSTRAP-PREP-V1` (supervised trusted-root construction), `ORCH-SETUP-V1`, then `ORCH-RUN-V1` (up to 24h). Bootstrap request limits: 6h, 6 builder attempts, one reviewer attempt per role, two heavy tests, 1,500,000 tokens, `no_auto_resume=true`. [Task 2]
- Envelope binds only target path, schema hash, construction-contract hash, and `preimage=ABSENT`; the activator creates actual approval-projection SHA, then binds claim/task/result/event. Keep SETUP/RUN claims separate; owner acquires `O_NOFOLLOW|O_CLOEXEC` advisory lock before LLM launch and restart increments epoch/fencing token. Reviewers independently materialize the exact candidate bundle and bind SHA, I/O hashes, command, exit, stdout/stderr, verdict, and limits. [Task 2]

## Failures and how to do differently

- Host-path configuration can disagree with Docker: `./data:/app/data` masked `/app/backend/data`, creating fallback and host/main-repo split-brain. Inspect compose mounts as well as host paths. [Task 1]
- Green mocks/helpers/source-string assertions are not production closure. Test real entrypoints, temporary real storage/Neo4j when authorized, and cold-cache/offline behavior. [Task 1]
- `/goal`, chat approval, or an ordinary agent message is not a control plane. Bootstrap-Prep is not Setup/Run authorization; first present exact challenge, action policy, and root-ABSENT evidence for narrow user approval. [Task 2]
- Before activation, verify every model turn/subprocess is terminal and has no writable FD, directory FD, mmap, or inherited handle to activation/claim/lock paths. [Task 2]


